WEBVTT

05:57:29.440 --> 05:57:31.750
We've watched that one. Now, RIZZ.

05:57:31.760 --> 05:57:34.270
Wait, what's this? Is this RIZZ?

05:57:34.280 --> 05:57:39.070
This is the one to watch, right?
Traditional-style RIZZ, then the solo stages.

05:57:39.080 --> 05:57:44.030
Hang on. If I'm being honest...

05:57:45.760 --> 05:57:52.830
I figured a lot of PLLI would show up
if I did a PLAVE watch-along.

05:57:52.840 --> 05:57:56.548
But I worried: what if my reactions
weren't fun to watch?

05:57:56.558 --> 05:58:01.110
Turns out the worries go away
as soon as you actually do it.

05:58:01.120 --> 05:58:04.990
Just do it. I'm eating this up.
I think I'm having the most fun here.

05:58:05.000 --> 05:58:08.270
I haven't heard the original RIZZ yet.

05:58:08.280 --> 05:58:12.468
Okay, RIZZ first. No, seriously...

05:58:12.478 --> 05:58:17.548
I was worried it might come off as forced.

05:58:17.558 --> 05:58:23.110
You know, going “Oh, wow!”
just because PLLI are watching.

05:58:23.120 --> 05:58:28.350
I was afraid it'd sound like
I was trying too hard.

05:58:28.360 --> 05:58:33.430
I was nervous, but what was I thinking?
This is fun as hell.

05:58:33.440 --> 05:58:36.628
I've got to watch it, don't I?

05:58:36.638 --> 05:58:39.138
The third one. The third one.

05:59:16.680 --> 05:59:19.070
For concerts, this is better.

06:00:06.680 --> 06:00:10.310
This is Bburinkle Chicken!
I had some today.

06:00:10.320 --> 06:00:15.390
My birthday was recently,
so I got a coupon for chicken.

06:00:15.400 --> 06:00:18.230
I picked Bburinkle Chicken today.

06:00:18.240 --> 06:00:22.240
I guess it was meant to be.
I ate it on the day I'm doing this!

06:00:28.558 --> 06:00:31.558
Let's hear where the Bburinkle part is.

06:00:49.478 --> 06:00:51.478
Oh, this is insane.

06:01:24.280 --> 06:01:26.780
Why do my cheeks hurt?

06:01:31.920 --> 06:01:33.920
I'm losing it.

06:01:49.558 --> 06:01:52.058
Oh, Bburinkle Chicken!

06:02:04.400 --> 06:02:08.190
I asked for sexy songs, and PLLI went,
“Bburinkle Chicken.”

06:02:08.200 --> 06:02:11.070
That's fucking hilarious. And next up...

06:02:11.080 --> 06:02:15.080
So this is the traditional Korean
Bburinkle Chicken?

06:02:24.080 --> 06:02:26.430
Oh! So that's what they mean by “it hits.”

06:02:26.440 --> 06:02:29.070
This is fucking insane.

06:02:29.080 --> 06:02:31.080
Seriously.

06:02:35.638 --> 06:02:40.310
Wait. Is this the original choreography?

06:02:40.320 --> 06:02:43.468
Is this how the dance originally goes?

06:02:45.200 --> 06:02:48.800
They changed it, right?

06:02:50.080 --> 06:02:52.750
It's so fucking good.

06:02:52.760 --> 06:02:57.150
So fucking good. It's unreal.

06:02:57.160 --> 06:03:01.110
If the dance had looked like this earlier,
I would've liked it even more.

06:03:01.120 --> 06:03:03.600
But... wow.

06:03:07.320 --> 06:03:10.000
That's so fucking cool.

06:03:26.520 --> 06:03:30.390
They're so fucking good at this.

06:03:30.400 --> 06:03:34.100
Choi Junyoung oversaw this version...

06:03:35.558 --> 06:03:38.500
Of course. A K-pop choreography god.

06:03:59.040 --> 06:04:02.030
Ah, I love this.

06:04:02.040 --> 06:04:04.500
It's so good.

06:04:07.120 --> 06:04:10.100
Eunho's voice makes it even better, right?

06:04:10.120 --> 06:04:12.868
Oh, that Bburinkle Chicken...

06:04:12.878 --> 06:04:16.110
Bet you didn't know sales went up. Wild.

06:04:46.638 --> 06:04:50.200
Whoa, I just had the exact same thought
as someone in chat.

06:05:06.478 --> 06:05:10.000
Wow. Seriously...

06:05:11.160 --> 06:05:14.199
And I mean this as the highest praise:

06:05:14.200 --> 06:05:18.910
Who even are you people? Seriously.

06:05:23.798 --> 06:05:28.708
Earlier... who was it again?

06:05:28.718 --> 06:05:30.628
I can't even talk.

06:05:30.638 --> 06:05:34.270
Someone said they'd get banned
for saying what they really thought.

06:05:36.400 --> 06:05:38.390
Now I get what they meant.

06:05:38.400 --> 06:05:42.310
If I said everything on my mind,
PLLI might drag me for it.

06:05:42.320 --> 06:05:45.390
I might even get banned on CHZZK. Seriously.

06:05:45.400 --> 06:05:47.948
Oh, I saw that. But...

06:05:47.958 --> 06:05:51.070
No, I don't think they'd drag me. Why?

06:05:51.080 --> 06:05:52.670
You'd all go just as far.

06:05:52.680 --> 06:05:56.500
Oh, Midpepper. Exactly.

06:06:07.360 --> 06:06:10.510
But if I'd heard that at the start,

06:06:10.520 --> 06:06:15.550
I'd have thought, “What could possibly
be that intense?”

06:06:17.478 --> 06:06:21.190
That's what I would've said. But, wow...

06:06:27.040 --> 06:06:29.468
Fuck, that's so cool.

06:06:29.478 --> 06:06:33.350
If this is how I react as a guy...

06:06:33.360 --> 06:06:37.750
I mean, it makes me think.

06:06:39.558 --> 06:06:42.110
Part of me wishes I were a woman fan.

06:06:42.120 --> 06:06:46.100
And right now, part of me is relieved I'm not.

06:06:47.798 --> 06:06:50.230
This should be a national treasure.

06:06:53.798 --> 06:06:58.708
Everyone, PLAVE must be declared
a national treasure!

06:06:58.718 --> 06:07:01.390
Okay, that's my little outburst. Next.

06:07:05.600 --> 06:07:08.390
A few people fainted? I can believe it.

06:07:08.400 --> 06:07:14.430
There's a lot here that's bad for your heart,
one way or another.

06:07:14.440 --> 06:07:16.708
How are you supposed to cope?

06:07:16.718 --> 06:07:21.628
The outfits and concepts change so fast,
you can't even brace yourself.

06:07:21.638 --> 06:07:24.468
Other idols take a break
to change outfits.

06:07:24.478 --> 06:07:29.548
You can sit there and guess,
“Oh, maybe this is the next song.”

06:07:29.558 --> 06:07:32.999
You have time to do that.

06:07:33.000 --> 06:07:38.468
With PLAVE, honestly,
once they've caught their breath,

06:07:38.478 --> 06:07:41.830
and they're good to go again,

06:07:41.840 --> 06:07:45.830
everything can just change, like that.

06:07:45.840 --> 06:07:47.430
It's insane.

06:07:47.440 --> 06:07:51.500
And if you scream a lot, you get dizzy.

06:08:12.400 --> 06:08:15.390
Getting a headache at their concert?
That's not weird at all.

06:08:15.400 --> 06:08:18.390
My head hurts right now.

06:08:18.400 --> 06:08:23.030
I really didn't think I'd react like this. Wow...

06:08:23.040 --> 06:08:26.110
The dancing is delicious.
The performances are delicious.

06:08:26.120 --> 06:08:29.708
They sound great live. And for starters...

06:08:29.718 --> 06:08:32.110
They're gorgeous. But the dancing...

06:08:32.120 --> 06:08:37.590
I'm just eating it up. The way the dance
builds and tells a story...

06:08:37.600 --> 06:08:42.110
The way it works in their lore...
It's all so good.

06:08:42.120 --> 06:08:45.500
Oh, the princess! Absolute god.

06:08:46.760 --> 06:08:50.750
But Bamby is also...

06:08:50.760 --> 06:08:52.468
delicious. Wait, that sounds...

06:08:52.478 --> 06:08:55.390
weird when I say it like that.
I mean he's cool.

06:08:55.400 --> 06:08:57.548
Honestly, they're all cool.

06:08:57.558 --> 06:09:01.200
Eunho, Yejun, Hamin...

06:09:14.200 --> 06:09:16.468
“The solos were so good, I'm dying.”

06:09:16.478 --> 06:09:19.910
Should I watch this one? It's in 4K.

06:09:24.878 --> 06:09:28.000
[Voice in clip] Oh, that's why the band...

06:09:29.160 --> 06:09:32.000
[Voice in clip] Oh, the dancers up front...

06:09:35.600 --> 06:09:39.230
Look at them screaming.

06:09:39.240 --> 06:09:43.590
How could you not scream too?

06:09:43.600 --> 06:09:48.300
[Voice in clip] Oh, that's why the band...
Oh, the dancers up front...

06:10:05.240 --> 06:10:10.500
Wow, that hair. Holy shit.
Look how sexy he is.

06:10:21.478 --> 06:10:24.599
Oh, no one expected a solo stage,
so everyone was shocked.

06:10:24.600 --> 06:10:28.199
And that was the new hairstyle reveal...

06:10:28.200 --> 06:10:33.600
Look, a solo stage.
Yejun told them to be quiet...

06:10:38.000 --> 06:10:41.910
Wait, it was Yejun's birthday? The 12th?

06:10:41.920 --> 06:10:45.590
Mine's a day earlier. I'm on the 11th.

06:10:45.600 --> 06:10:48.030
“Trade birthdays?” That's what they said.

06:10:48.040 --> 06:10:50.150
Ah, maybe it's better this way.

06:10:50.160 --> 06:10:53.200
The 12th. Good thing it's not my birthday.

06:10:55.798 --> 06:11:00.800
But I'm never going to forget
Yejun's birthday now.

06:11:01.200 --> 06:11:05.600
The day after my birthday
is PLAVE Yejun's birthday?

06:11:10.840 --> 06:11:13.400
Wait, has he started?

06:11:21.200 --> 06:11:24.300
He started a cappella?

06:11:30.680 --> 06:11:35.230
He's murdering PLLI out here.
Hold on...

06:11:35.240 --> 06:11:37.628
Uh, hello?

06:11:37.638 --> 06:11:42.990
Yes, I'm at the concert, and...

06:11:43.000 --> 06:11:45.948
There's a terrorist here. Yes.

06:11:45.958 --> 06:11:47.788
People are screaming.

06:11:47.798 --> 06:11:50.510
Yes. Yes. It's been a while,

06:11:50.520 --> 06:11:53.590
but every time I hear this, it's chaos.
I'm not kidding.

06:11:56.680 --> 06:12:00.628
Yes, I'm in the concert venue bathroom.

06:12:00.638 --> 06:12:04.200
No, seriously. It's crazy here.

06:12:21.958 --> 06:12:24.708
Oh, wait a second.

06:12:45.840 --> 06:12:48.200
God tier!

06:12:56.920 --> 06:12:59.200
Ah, fuck.

06:13:08.080 --> 06:13:12.868
Hold on. Hold on...

06:13:12.878 --> 06:13:14.948
Why are you trying to seduce me?!

06:13:14.958 --> 06:13:18.200
Wait a second. Seriously...

06:13:21.080 --> 06:13:24.150
No, I mean... Seriously.

06:13:24.160 --> 06:13:27.868
I'm not into guys, okay?

06:13:27.878 --> 06:13:30.350
But this... This is insane.

06:13:30.360 --> 06:13:32.750
What am I supposed to do? Everyone...

06:13:32.760 --> 06:13:36.510
Wow, I just...

06:13:36.520 --> 06:13:39.270
This is killing me.

06:13:39.280 --> 06:13:42.300
Seriously, this...

06:13:46.638 --> 06:13:50.000
Yeah, I get it.

06:14:35.160 --> 06:14:38.200
Fuck, he's handsome.

06:14:39.878 --> 06:14:43.000
He's so damn sexy. [Laughs]

06:15:13.638 --> 06:15:16.070
Wow, this...

06:15:16.080 --> 06:15:19.788
Hang on. No, this is...

06:15:19.798 --> 06:15:23.628
I'm not joking around here.

06:15:23.638 --> 06:15:26.510
Let me watch to the end first.

06:15:26.520 --> 06:15:30.100
Wow. This doesn't make sense.

06:15:48.520 --> 06:15:52.788
Fuck, he's handsome.

06:15:52.798 --> 06:15:54.990
Isn't he just a genius?

06:15:55.000 --> 06:15:59.500
A visual genius, too. He can do it all.

06:16:21.080 --> 06:16:24.600
Wait, it's in black and white?

06:16:28.798 --> 06:16:31.600
Is it raining? Oh...

06:16:37.798 --> 06:16:40.468
Hold on. Seriously, hold on.

06:16:40.478 --> 06:16:44.230
Ja, everyone, bathroom break.

06:16:44.240 --> 06:16:47.510
I can't do this. Ja, here's what
I was going to say earlier:

06:16:47.520 --> 06:16:50.310
I'd need a diaper to go to their concert.

06:16:50.320 --> 06:16:54.190
I'm not kidding. I mean it.

06:16:55.878 --> 06:16:59.000
This is unreal.

06:17:01.280 --> 06:17:04.800
I'll put on DASH.

06:17:06.360 --> 06:17:09.510
The music video? The performance?

06:17:09.520 --> 06:17:12.390
I'll leave the music video on.

06:17:12.400 --> 06:17:14.519
This is unreal.

06:17:14.520 --> 06:17:17.500
I'll go sort this out peacefully. Yeah.
